        "type": "game",
        "name": "M.A.L.M.O : Scorched Earth",
        "steam_appid": 3648440,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648440/extras/ea3635628d83b8a74c0bf04c175def2d.avif?t=1769162692\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an <i>Open World Game</i> Set in Sweden during a fictional radioactive zombie apocalypse, An Iraqi Gun Dealer named <i><strong>Abdulaziz</strong></i> finds a supplier named <i><strong>Simon</strong></i> in Malmö, Sweden. in which a forced signage of a binding contract turns a simple gun deal into a nightmare scenario for <i><strong>Abdulaziz.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's Movement is heavily inspired by <strong>CS:GO's</strong> and <strong>Half-Life</strong>'s Source Engine Based Bunnyhopping, I've always loved this type of movement and adapting it to an Open World game was a blast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your current Goals?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay 300 Zombies, and loot them for <i>Scrap </i>and<i> Ammunition</i>, about this <i>Scrap</i> we're gonna talk about later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot as many Stashes you can find around the map, with 100 graciously sprinkled upon the land of Malmö.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level your character up with 3 different categories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Extra Speed: Increases <i><strong>Abdulaziz</strong></i>'s Air Cap, Causing him to go Faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Juggernaut: Much faster emergency health output (think <strong>Far Cry's</strong> health regen).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Scrapper: Makes the random piles of <i>Scrap</i> around the map output much more <i>Scrap</i> than usual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the 10 Missions (I mean if you want to, its optional after all) to earn all the XP in the world, and level up even more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in the Minigames around the map. (fishing, cards.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and Sell in the game's <strong>huge</strong> market, by using the as said <i>Scrap</i> you can buy everything from bandages to AK's all the way to Electric Snipers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After doing all that, get the hell outta there!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648440/extras/9e13fe8e5df7f17fccd31e8b01742275.avif?t=1769162692\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M.A.L.M.O : Scorched Earth's Features are Almost Endless, of which:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibly fast movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Weapons and a complex <i>Weapon Jamming</i> system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying and Selling Guns and Ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Steam Integrated Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MASSIVE map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, <strong>It's FREE!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? <u>Start playing now!</u></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648440/extras/ea3635628d83b8a74c0bf04c175def2d.avif?t=1769162692\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an <i>Open World Game</i> Set in Sweden during a fictional radioactive zombie apocalypse, An Iraqi Gun Dealer named <i><strong>Abdulaziz</strong></i> finds a supplier named <i><strong>Simon</strong></i> in Malmö, Sweden. in which a forced signage of a binding contract turns a simple gun deal into a nightmare scenario for <i><strong>Abdulaziz.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's Movement is heavily inspired by <strong>CS:GO's</strong> and <strong>Half-Life</strong>'s Source Engine Based Bunnyhopping, I've always loved this type of movement and adapting it to an Open World game was a blast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your current Goals?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay 300 Zombies, and loot them for <i>Scrap </i>and<i> Ammunition</i>, about this <i>Scrap</i> we're gonna talk about later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot as many Stashes you can find around the map, with 100 graciously sprinkled upon the land of Malmö.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level your character up with 3 different categories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Extra Speed: Increases <i><strong>Abdulaziz</strong></i>'s Air Cap, Causing him to go Faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Juggernaut: Much faster emergency health output (think <strong>Far Cry's</strong> health regen).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Scrapper: Makes the random piles of <i>Scrap</i> around the map output much more <i>Scrap</i> than usual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the 10 Missions (I mean if you want to, its optional after all) to earn all the XP in the world, and level up even more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in the Minigames around the map. (fishing, cards.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and Sell in the game's <strong>huge</strong> market, by using the as said <i>Scrap</i> you can buy everything from bandages to AK's all the way to Electric Snipers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After doing all that, get the hell outta there!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648440/extras/9e13fe8e5df7f17fccd31e8b01742275.avif?t=1769162692\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M.A.L.M.O : Scorched Earth's Features are Almost Endless, of which:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredibly fast movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Weapons and a complex <i>Weapon Jamming</i> system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying and Selling Guns and Ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Steam Integrated Achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MASSIVE map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, <strong>It's FREE!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? <u>Start playing now!</u></p>",
        "short_description": "M.A.L.M.O : Scorched Earth is an open world, fast paced, first-person shooter. The Goal: Get rid of the Parasitic Zombie Population in the entirety of SOUTHERN SWEDEN!, and loot the city from up to down, and go FAST with the Source Engine Inspired Bunnyhopping System.",
